# GENERAL PURPOSE:
# Check before sudo: if this login is already root, run the command without
# sudo. Otherwise invoke sudo (password OK; never sudo -n here).
#
# CIAO PRINCIPLES APPLIED:
# - Caution: nested sudo after outer "sudo setup" must not prompt again
